# [CompliRules] EAA 2025 & EN 301 549 Multi-Modal Accessible Authentication & Checkout Standards
**Severity:** `CRITICAL` | **Jurisdiction:** `EAA_EU`

<!-- NOTICE: CompliRules provides automated AST guardrails under CompliRules Free-to-Use License without warranty (See DISCLAIMER.md). Documentation: https://halilyilmz.github.io/complirules/ -->

## Legal Citations
- **Directive (EU) 2019/882 (European Accessibility Act - EAA 2025) (Annex I, Section I & III)**: E-commerce services and identification methods must provide accessible, perceivable, and operable user interfaces without discriminatory technical barriers.
- **Harmonised European Standard EN 301 549 v3.2.1 (Clause 5.3 (Biometrics))**: Where ICT uses biological characteristics for authentication, it shall not rely on any single biological characteristic and shall provide at least one non-biometric alternative.

## Rule Mandates
- MUST: MUST provide at least one non-biometric authentication alternative (TOTP authenticator app, accessible code, or password) on the same tier whenever biometric/passkey auth is offered (EN 301 549 Clause 5.3).
- MUST: NEVER create a biometric-only lockout for users unable to provide facial or fingerprint scans.
- MUST: MUST maintain visible, unobscured focus rings (:focus-visible) across all interactive checkout and authentication controls.
- MUST: MUST announce form errors via role="alert" and inline error text next to the offending input.

## Forbidden Anti-Patterns
- NEVER: Biometric-only 2FA or passkey flow without accessible fallback
- NEVER: outline: none or outline: 0 without visible focus replacement on checkout buttons

## Reference Compliant Code Snippets
### Accessible Multi-Modal MFA Switcher
```typescript
export function AccessibleMfaSelector({ selectedModality, onSelect }: { 
  selectedModality: 'BIOMETRIC' | 'TOTP_APP'; 
  onSelect: (m: 'BIOMETRIC' | 'TOTP_APP') => void;
}) {
  return (
    <div role="tablist" aria-label="Authentication Modalities" className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
      <button
        type="button"
        role="tab"
        aria-selected={selectedModality === 'BIOMETRIC'}
        onClick={() => onSelect('BIOMETRIC')}
        className="p-2.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-md border focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-blue-500"
      >
        Biometrics / Passkey
      </button>
      <button
        type="button"
        role="tab"
        aria-selected={selectedModality === 'TOTP_APP'}
        onClick={() => onSelect('TOTP_APP')}
        className="p-2.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-md border focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-blue-500"
      >
        Authenticator Code (TOTP)
      </button>
    </div>
  );
}
```
